- About: founder credibility, Aligned Growth Digital relationship, AboutPage schema
- Visibility analysis: opportunity framing; lead form trimmed (2 fields removed,
  optional website added); FormSubmit behavior preserved
- BaseLayout: Organization/parent Organization/Person entity graph, extraSchema
  prop, og:image, dev-server noindex; nav + footer updated

