+---
+/**
+ * ConversionPaths — two paths from search to a booked job:
+ * A) Digital: search → landing page → online quote → availability → book
+ * B) Phone:   search → call → human / AI-assisted response → schedule → book
+ * Includes the partner-technology disclosure.
+ */
