- PartnerCallout component: secondary, recommend-and-connect language with
  disclosure; ConversionPaths neutralized; all partner-powered wording removed
- About: principle, Growth OS explanation, partner transparency statement
- Header nav tightened to keep seven links on one line at 1024–1199px

