+  {
+    question: "What makes an auto glass website different from a normal small-business website?",
+    answer: "Auto glass demand is urgent, local and service-specific, and most of it arrives on a phone. An auto glass website needs a dedicated page for each service and each market you serve, insurance and ADAS answers where the driver is deciding, tap-to-call and a short quote form above the fold, fast mobile load times, and tracking on every call and form. A generic template with a services list and a contact page captures very little of that demand.",
