+    question: "Do we need a new website, or can you improve the one we have?",
+    answer: "It depends on the foundation. If the current site is fast, crawlable and structurally sound, conversion optimization and new service or location pages are usually the better investment. If it is slow, built on a template that fights the architecture, or impossible to track, a rebuild is often cheaper than patching. The opportunity analysis looks at your current site before we recommend either.",
+  },
