+  },
+  {
+    question: "Will the website work with our Google Ads and Google Business Profile?",
+    answer: "That is the point of building it this way. The service and location pages double as Google Ads landing pages, the Google Business Profile links to the matching location page, and the same business information runs through the site, the profile and the schema so search and AI systems see one consistent company. One site serves every channel.",
+  },
