+    <p>
+      If your website is structurally sound, the fastest gains usually come from conversion optimization — improving the path between landing on the site and becoming a qualified opportunity. CRO is an Auto Glass Growth service, and it covers:
+    </p>
+    <ul class="prose-grid">
+      <li><strong>CTA clarity</strong> One obvious next step on every page, not five competing buttons.</li>
+      <li><strong>Click-to-call</strong> Visible, tappable, tracked — and shown before the driver has to scroll.</li>
+      <li><strong>Forms and quote-request UX</strong> Short forms that ask only what you need to respond, with a realistic response promise.</li>
+      <li><strong>Landing pages</strong> Service- and market-specific pages that match the search and the ad.</li>
+      <li><strong>Mobile conversion</strong> Speed, layout and tap targets on the device most auto glass searches happen on.</li>
+      <li><strong>Trust placement</strong> Reviews, warranty, insurance and ADAS information where the decision is made.</li>
+      <li><strong>Service information and navigation</strong> Drivers find what you do and where in seconds.</li>
+      <li><strong>Customer journey</strong> The full path from first tap to scheduled job, measured end to end.</li>
+    </ul>
